infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Flame graph vs trace — what is hot vs when it ran
  desc Same stacks, opposite x-axis — read a flame graph vertically, a trace left to right
  compares
    - label Flame graph
      children
        - label X-axis = alphabetical
          desc Sorted by stack path, never call order
        - label Width = sample count
          desc Wide frame = where CPU time is spent
        - label Read top to bottom
          desc Pick a wide leaf, walk down to its caller
        - label Answers WHAT is hot
          desc Which function is burning the CPU
    - label Trace timeline
      children
        - label X-axis = wall-clock time
          desc Spans laid out in execution order
        - label Width = span duration
          desc How long each step actually took
        - label Read left to right
          desc Sequential order within one request
        - label Answers WHEN it ran
          desc Where each step sits in the request
theme
  palette #6366f1 #0ea5e9
